			"date": "2023-01-23T17:08:57.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://m.nintendojo.fr/@meduz\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>meduz</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://m.webtoo.ls/@elk\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>elk</span></a></span> Neutrality means showing every new follow as a small avatar only? Would you create an issue to discuss if that is the case? I'm a little bit worried about adding too many options though.</p>",
