			},
			"date": "2023-01-23T17:18:26.117Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://m.nintendojo.fr/@meduz\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>meduz</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://m.webtoo.ls/@patak\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>patak</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://m.webtoo.ls/@elk\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>elk</span></a></span> a nice middle ground might be anyone with an avatar photo and a header image! I like the opt-in based on how much work the user has put into their profile 🏆 (but would also agree that a min-follower count feels a tiny bit awkward)</p>",
